      "hints": [
        "Find the gradient of $AB$: $m_{AB} = \\dfrac{3 - 1}{5 - 1} = \\dfrac{2}{4} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$.",
        "Since $CD$ is parallel to $AB$, equate $m_{CD} = \\dfrac{k - 8}{2 - 6} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$.",
        "Solve $\\dfrac{k - 8}{-4} = \\dfrac{1}{2} \\implies k - 8 = -2 \\implies k = 6$."
