        "Parallel sides have equal gradients.\nCalculate the gradient of $AB$:\n$$m_{AB} = \\dfrac{3 - 1}{5 - 1} = \\dfrac{2}{4} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$$",
        "Equate $m_{CD}$ to $m_{AB}$ and solve for $k$:\n$$m_{CD} = \\dfrac{k - 8}{2 - 6} = \\dfrac{k - 8}{-4} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$$\n$$k - 8 = -2 \\implies k = 6$$"
